","text":"Example"},{"type":"h","text":"Requirement:"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an e-commerce platform supporting 1 million users."},{"type":"p","text":"The architect must think about:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Users","CDN","Load Balancer","API Gateway","Application Services"]},{"type":"p","text":"├── User Service"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Product Service"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Order Service"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Payment Service"},{"type":"flow","items":["└── Notification Service","Message Broker","Databases"]},{"type":"p","text":"Then evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Where should caching be used?"},{"text":"Which database is appropriate?"},{"text":"How should payments be secured?"},{"text":"How does the system handle traffic spikes?"},{"text":"What happens if a service fails?"},{"text":"How are transactions handled?"},{"text":"How should data be partitioned?"},{"text":"How will the system be monitored?"}]}]},{"heading":"Important Architecture Patterns","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Layered Architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Presentation","Application","Business Logic","Data Access","Database"]},{"type":"h","text":"Microservices"},{"type":"p","text":"API Gateway"},{"type":"p","text":"|"},{"type":"p","text":"┌───────────┼───────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"User Service Order Payment"},{"type":"p","text":"Service Service"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"DB DB DB"},{"type":"h","text":"Event-Driven"},{"type":"flow","items":["Service A","Event Broker"]},{"type":"p","text":"├──→ Service B"},{"type":"p","text":"├──→ Service C"},{"type":"p","text":"└──→ Service D"},{"type":"p","text":"Students should understand the trade-offs of each architecture."}]},{"heading":"Tools & Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Java"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"C++ or C#"},{"text":"Bash"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spring Boot"},{"text":"Spring Security"},{"text":"REST"},{"text":"GraphQL fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"MongoDB"},{"text":"Redis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Messaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Apache Kafka"},{"text":"RabbitMQ"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Containers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Kubernetes fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"p","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"OR"},{"type":"p","text":"Azure"},{"type":"p","text":"OR"},{"type":"p","text":"Google Cloud"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Terraform fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture & Documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UML"},{"text":"C4 Model"},{"text":"Architecture Decision Records"},{"text":"Draw.io"},{"text":"Mermaid"},{"text":"Swagger/OpenAPI"}]}]},{"heading":"Design Patterns","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should know both the pattern and the problem it solves."},{"type":"h","text":"Creational"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Singleton"},{"text":"Factory"},{"text":"Abstract Factory"},{"text":"Builder"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Structural"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adapter"},{"text":"Decorator"},{"text":"Facade"},{"text":"Proxy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioral"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Observer"},{"text":"Command"},{"text":"Template Method"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Enterprise / Application Patterns"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Repository"},{"text":"Service Layer"},{"text":"Dependency Injection"},{"text":"MVC"},{"text":"CQRS fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"More important than memorizing patterns is understanding:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Constraints","Possible Designs","Trade-offs","Selected Architecture"]}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Scalable E-Commerce Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User authentication"},{"text":"Product catalog"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Payments simulation"},{"text":"Notifications"},{"text":"Admin dashboard"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Frontend","API Gateway","Backend Services","Redis + PostgreSQL","Kafka","Notification Service"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — URL Shortener"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a production-style URL shortener."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hashing"},{"text":"Database design"},{"text":"Caching"},{"text":"Rate limiting"},{"text":"Horizontal scaling"},{"text":"Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Client","Load Balancer","URL Service","Redis","Database"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Food Delivery Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Restaurant service"},{"text":"Delivery service"},{"text":"Order service"},{"text":"Payment service"},{"text":"Notification service"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microservices"},{"text":"Kafka/RabbitMQ"},{"text":"Redis"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Docker"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The emphasis should be on architecture decisions, not simply application features."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Real-Time Chat System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User authentication"},{"text":"One-to-one messaging"},{"text":"Group messaging"},{"text":"Online status"},{"text":"Message persistence"},{"text":"Notifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WebSockets"},{"text":"Message brokers"},{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"Horizontal scaling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Architecture Case Study Portfolio